{
  "$description": "TestGrid design tokens, direction A 'Signal'. Mirrors tokens.css. statusMap ties every API enum value (contracts §2.1 and §3) to a colour role and an icon; icons are 16x16 viewBox stroke paths (stroke-width 1.6, round caps and joins, no fill).",
